<rule #flow-runtime.rules.owner-boundaries.owner_boundaries apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "rule" applies_to = ["modeling://domain/flow/definition" "modeling://domain/flow/runtime_lifecycle"] } [
  <rule ?01M0NJZ4NS0Q710HX8FADFBZJV>
  canonical XNL definition、derived execution plan 和 runtime snapshot MUST remain separate facts。
  </?01M0NJZ4NS0Q710HX8FADFBZJV>
  <rationale ?01M0NJZ4NS0Q710HX8FADFBZJW>
  避免把执行事实、编辑投影或布局误写回 DSL；保持 DEPA data/effect/processor/actor 的 owner 清晰。
  </?01M0NJZ4NS0Q710HX8FADFBZJW>
  <enforcement ?01M0NJZ4NS0Q710HX8FADFBZJX>
  loader/compiler 只读 definition 并生成可重建 plan；runtime stores 通过 ports 注入；测试检查 snapshot、task facts 和 derived plan 不反写 canonical XNL。
  </?01M0NJZ4NS0Q710HX8FADFBZJX>
  <rule ?01M0NJZ4NS0Q710HX8FADFBZJY>
  Flow execution MUST delegate all external IO, clock, storage and child lifecycle operations to explicit runtime ports。
  </?01M0NJZ4NS0Q710HX8FADFBZJY>
  <rule ?01M0NJZ4NS0Q710HX8FADFBZJZ>
  每个 runtime fact 只能有一个明确 owner；不同 profile 不得共享未声明的 mutable state。
  </?01M0NJZ4NS0Q710HX8FADFBZJZ>
  <related ?01M0NJZ4NS0Q710HX8FADFBZK0>
  behavior://flow-dsl-runtime/requirements/canonical-compile-projection、modeling://domain/flow/definition
  </?01M0NJZ4NS0Q710HX8FADFBZK0>
]>
